(text "5 V safety loop: all series parts closed = relays K1/K2 on" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 99.06 137.16 0) (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "981fd87c-58c5-4be7-a9fe-445c53a5bb0c"))
(text "Printer power safety – step 7: smoke detector supervision relay K3" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 27.94 30.48 0) (effects (font (size 2.5 2.5) (bold yes)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "34f9e595-7353-48c6-a25b-821a488b7ad4"))
(text "Step 7: K3 coil on the detector 12 V supply, K3 NO contact in series with the SD119 NC contact." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 27.94 226.06 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "1b43e3ad-de61-4aeb-a892-9395c6a2c1e7"))
(text "No 12 V -> K3 drops -> loop opens -> power off. Nano: STOP ok + SMOKE ok + LOOP open = detector unpowered." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 27.94 229.87 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "09e6368e-503f-42e9-9d43-c3b345682bc3"))
(text "Detector head removed from base -> C-NC open (relay in the head) -> loop open. Check this on your SD119 base." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 27.94 233.68 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "99cf220a-d084-4cef-a21d-8df76a563c3a"))
